// ===========================================================================
//  TRUMAN ELECTRONICS — the complete website in one file
//
//  Every page, the shop, the product photos, the logo, the Arabic
//  translations and the Paymob payment integration are inside this file.
//  Nothing else is required to run it.
//
//  RUN LOCALLY        node server.js          (needs Node 18 or newer)
//                     then open http://localhost:3000
//
//  DEPLOY ON RAILWAY  Railway needs one extra file to recognise this as a
//                     Node app. Create package.json next to this file with:
//
//                         {
//                           "name": "truman-site",
//                           "version": "1.0.0",
//                           "scripts": { "start": "node server.js" },
//                           "engines": { "node": ">=18" }
//                         }
//
//  PRICES             Scroll to EMBEDDED_CATALOG at the bottom and edit them.
//                     Amounts are in piastres: 145000 = EGP 1,450.00
//                     Or drop a catalog.json next to this file; it takes
//                     priority, so you can change prices without touching code.
//
//  PAYMENTS           Runs in demo mode until these environment variables
//                     are set (no money moves until then):
//                       PAYMOB_SECRET_KEY, PAYMOB_PUBLIC_KEY,
//                       PAYMOB_HMAC_SECRET, PAYMOB_INTEGRATION_IDS, SITE_URL
//
//  EDITING PAGES      Files in the repo (index.html, shop.html, ...) take
//                     priority over the copies bundled below.
//
//  CATALOGUE PDF      Not bundled (~4 MB). To offer the download, place the
//                     file at Truman-Catalogue.pdf next to this file.
// ===========================================================================
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Truman Electronics — static server + shop + Paymob payments
// Zero npm dependencies. Node 18+ (uses built-in fetch + crypto).
//
// SECURITY MODEL
//   * Prices are read from catalog.json on the server. Anything the browser
//     sends about price/total is ignored and recomputed.
//   * An order is only marked PAID by the HMAC-verified Paymob webhook.
//     The browser redirect is treated as a hint for the UI, never as proof.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
